  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Honey_Toast?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6d/Honey_Toast.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211164950\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Honey toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey toast\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Honey toast</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 69</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 255</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 31</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Sandwich Bar</span><span title=\"Sandwich bar\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/sandwich-bar-9403\" title=\"Sandwich Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sandwich Bar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 71</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">51 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Honey toasts</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 69. They are not used to make any other product.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making honey toasts</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b0/Sandwich_Bar.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925211004\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Sandwich Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sandwich Bar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Sandwich Bar</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Honey toasts are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/sandwich-bar-9403\" title=\"Sandwich Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sandwich Bar</a>.\n</p><p>To make a toast, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/bread-2084\" title=\"Bread\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bread\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/egg-2058\" title=\"Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/milk-2141\" title=\"Milk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Milk\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/honey-15777\" title=\"Honey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 1 hour to make one toast, and 51 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> Bar. Each toast gives players 31 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling honey toasts</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Honey toasts can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,556 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 toasts.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make a toast costs 225&#160;<span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 3 to 4 honey toasts per crate, up to a total of 16 per boat.</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Honey Toast may sound like it's just honey on toast, but its&#160;ingredients would suggest that the toast is actually eggy bread, or french toast.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-sandwich-bar-products-9444\" title=\"Category:Sandwich Bar Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sandwich Bar Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-toast-11995\" title=\"Bacon Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon Toast\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cucumber-sandwich-30756\" title=\"Cucumber Sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cucumber Sandwich\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/egg-sandwich-9429\" title=\"Egg Sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Egg Sandwich\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-cheese-toast-26431\" title=\"Goat Cheese Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Cheese Toast\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/honey-toast-15783\" title=\"Honey Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey Toast\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/hummus-wrap-35388\" title=\"Hummus Wrap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hummus Wrap\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/onion-melt-29367\" title=\"Onion Melt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Onion Melt\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/peanut-butter-and-jelly-sandwich-33955\" title=\"Peanut Butter and Jelly Sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peanut Butter and Jelly Sandwich\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-bagel-9427\" title=\"Veggie Bagel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Veggie Bagel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901024748\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 953/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6729/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1229/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 940269/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   92.034      1 -total\n 79.17%   72.862      1 Template:Infobox\n 36.31%   33.418      9 Template:Infoicon\n 13.46%   12.392      1 Template:Navigation\n  7.56%    6.958      1 Template:SandwichBarMenu\n  2.05%    1.889      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.75%    1.610      1 Template:Languages\n  1.50%    1.381      3 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:15783-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901024748 and revision id 107264. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
